    <p style="color:var(--slate);font-size:15px">Most questions get answered faster by going straight to the right place.</p></div>
  <div class="ct-routes"><div class="ct-route"><a class="ct-route__img" href="/pages/tire-search" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ 'netlify-contact-05-0fd8f1413e8cdac8.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="A service advisor reviewing tire and wheel pricing with a customer" width="560" height="380" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#c51f28" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9.2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.4"/><path d="M12 2.8v5.8M12 15.4v5.8M2.8 12h5.8M15.4 12h5.8"/></svg></span></a><div class="ct-route__body"><h3>Pricing a tire or wheel</h3><p>Search by vehicle or size to see what fits and what it costs, then take the quote to any store.</p><a class="go" href="/pages/tire-search">Search tires &rarr;</a></div></div><div class="ct-route"><a class="ct-route__img" href="/pages/services" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ 'netlify-contact-06-ba733e16a7fb5f5f.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="A certified technician carrying out auto service in the workshop" width="560" height="380" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#c51f28" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M16 2v4M8 2v4M3 10h18"/><path d="M8.5 14.5h3v3h-3z" fill="#c51f28" stroke="none"/></svg></span></a><div class="ct-route__body"><h3>Booking a service</h3><p>Oil changes, brakes, alignments and fitting. Book online, or call the store to move a visit already set.</p><a class="go" href="/pages/services">Book a service &rarr;</a></div></div><div class="ct-route"><a class="ct-route__img" href="/pages/locations" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ 'netlify-contact-07-962434721edbdacd.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="The American Tire Stores storefront in Ventura, California" width="560" height="380" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#c51f28" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.5 6a3.8 3.8 0 0 0 5 5l-8.9 8.9a2.6 2.6 0 0 1-3.7-3.7z"/><path d="M14.5 6 18 2.5"/></svg></span></a><div class="ct-route__body"><h3>A job already in progress</h3><p>Call the store doing the work. They have the ticket, the parts order and the technician.</p><a class="go" href="/pages/locations">Find your store &rarr;</a></div></div><div class="ct-route"><a class="ct-route__img" href="#ct-form" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ 'netlify-contact-08-20bad8365fe18df2.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="A service advisor helping a customer at the counter" width="560" height="380" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#c51f28" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M9 13h6M9 17h6"/></svg></span></a><div class="ct-route__body"><h3>Billing, warranty or feedback</h3><p>These go to customer service rather than to an individual store. Use the form further down the page.</p><a class="go" href="#ct-form">Send a message &rarr;</a></div></div></div>
</div></section>

