<section class="block" id="ct-form"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><div class="sec-eye">Send a message</div><h2>Customer Service</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--slate);font-size:15px">For billing, warranty, feedback and general questions.
      Anything urgent or vehicle-specific is faster by phone.</p></div>
  <div class="ct-formwrap">
    {% form 'contact', class: 'ct-form', id: 'contactForm' %}
      {% if form.posted_successfully? %}
        <div class="ct-ok" role="status" style="display:block">Thanks &mdash; your message has been sent. We'll reply
          by email during business hours.</div>
      {% endif %}
      {% if form.errors %}
        <div class="ct-ok" role="alert" style="display:block">Please check your name, email, and message, then try again.</div>
      {% endif %}
      <div class="ct-row">
        <div class="ct-field"><label for="cf-name">Your name <span class="req">*</span></label>
          <input id="cf-name" name="contact[name]" type="text" autocomplete="name" required></div>
        <div class="ct-field"><label for="cf-email">Email <span class="req">*</span></label>
          <input id="cf-email" name="contact[email]" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></div>
      </div>
      <div class="ct-row">
        <div class="ct-field"><label for="cf-phone">Phone (optional)</label>
          <input id="cf-phone" name="contact[phone]" type="tel" autocomplete="tel"></div>
        <div class="ct-field"><label for="cf-store">Which store</label>
          <select id="cf-store" name="contact[Store]"><option value="Downey">Downey</option>
            <option value="" selected>Not store-specific</option><option value="Ventura">Ventura</option><option value="Thousand Oaks">Thousand Oaks</option><option value="Valencia">Valencia</option><option value="Hollywood">Hollywood</option><option value="Glendale">Glendale</option><option value="Glendale 2">Glendale 2</option><option value="Bellflower">Bellflower</option><option value="Costa Mesa">Costa Mesa</option><option value="Cathedral City">Cathedral City</option></select></div>
      </div>
      <div class="ct-field"><label for="cf-topic">What is this about? <span class="req">*</span></label>
        <select id="cf-topic" name="contact[Reason]" required>
          <option value="">Choose a topic&hellip;</option>
          <option>Billing or an invoice</option>
          <option>Warranty or a road hazard claim</option>
          <option>Feedback about a visit</option>
          <option>Rebate or promotion question</option>
          <option>Fleet or commercial enquiry</option>
          <option>Careers</option>
          <option>Something else</option>
        </select></div>
      <div class="ct-field"><label for="cf-msg">Message <span class="req">*</span></label>
        <textarea id="cf-msg" name="contact[body]" required></textarea>
        <span class="ct-hint">If it relates to a past visit, including the store and roughly when you
          came in helps us find the ticket faster.</span></div>
      <div class="ct-submit">
        <button class="btn btn-red" type="submit">Send message &rarr;</button>
        <span class="ct-hint">We reply during business hours, Monday to Friday.</span>
      </div>
    {% endform %}
    <aside class="ct-aside">
      <div class="ct-panel urgent"><h3>Need an answer today?</h3>
        <p>The form is not monitored outside business hours. For anything time-sensitive &mdash; a car
          already in the bay, a same-day fitting, a quote you need now &mdash;
          <a href="#ct-stores" >call the store</a>.</p></div>
      <div class="ct-panel"><h3>Customer service</h3>
        <span class="big"><a href="mailto:customerservice@americantirestores.com">customerservice@americantirestores.com</a></span>
        <p>Mon&ndash;Fri 8:00am&ndash;6:00pm PT &middot; Sat 8:00am&ndash;5:00pm PT</p></div>
      <div class="ct-panel"><h3>Before you write in</h3>
        <p><b>Rebate status?</b> Manufacturer rebates are processed by the tire brand, not by us. Check the
          rebate portal on your submission receipt &mdash; see <a href="/pages/promotions">current promotions</a>.</p>
        <p><b>Warranty claim?</b> Start with the store that did the work. They hold the invoice and can
          begin the claim on the spot.</p>
        <p><b>Financing question?</b> Applications are handled by our financing partner on their own
          system &mdash; see the <a href="/pages/financing">financing page</a>.</p></div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="block alt" id="ct-faq"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><div class="sec-eye">Common questions</div><h2>Before You Get in Touch</h2></div>
  <div class="faq"><details class="qa" id="qa0" open><summary><span>What is the fastest way to get a price on tires?</span><span class="ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="a"><p>Use the tire search to see what fits your vehicle and what it costs, then bring the quote to any store. If you would rather talk it through, call your nearest store and an advisor will price it with you.</p></div></details><details class="qa" id="qa1"><summary><span>How do I book or change an appointment?</span><span class="ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="a"><p>New appointments can be booked online. To move or cancel one that is already scheduled, call the store directly — they hold the booking.</p></div></details><details class="qa" id="qa2"><summary><span>How long does a reply to the contact form take?</span><span class="ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="a"><p>We reply during business hours, Monday to Friday. Anything urgent should go to the store by phone instead.</p></div></details><details class="qa" id="qa3"><summary><span>Do you take walk-ins?</span><span class="ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="a"><p>Walk-ins are welcome when the store has availability. Calling ahead is the best way to confirm timing for a specific service.</p></div></details><details class="qa" id="qa4"><summary><span>Where do I check the status of a mail-in rebate?</span><span class="ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="a"><p>Manufacturer rebates are processed by the tire brand, not by American Tire Stores. Your submission receipt carries the rebate portal and a claim reference. If you cannot find it, the store that sold you the tires can look up the purchase.</p></div></details><details class="qa" id="qa5"><summary><span>Who do I contact about a warranty or road hazard claim?</span><span class="ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="a"><p>Start with the store that performed the work. They have the invoice and can begin the claim without you needing to write in first.</p></div></details><details class="qa" id="qa6"><summary><span>Can I get a copy of an invoice or receipt?</span><span class="ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="a"><p>Yes. The store that did the work can reprint it. Call them with the approximate date and the vehicle, or use the form and choose "Billing or an invoice".</p></div></details><details class="qa" id="qa7"><summary><span>How do I apply for a job?</span><span class="ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="a"><p>Choose "Careers" in the form above and tell us which store and what kind of role interests you. Our team will route your message to the appropriate contact.</p></div></details></div>
</div></section>

<section class="final"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Still Not Sure Who to Ask?</h2>
  <p>Call the store nearest you. If it is not something they handle, they will point you to who does.</p>
  <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
    <a class="btn btn-red" href="#ct-stores" >See all store numbers &rarr;</a>
    <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/pages/promotions">See current offers</a>
  </div>
</div></section>
</div>

